OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night: Biggest police
OL,4,Aoperation of the year gets underway
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers from around the country
OL,7,Fhave gathered in Edinburgh for Bonfire
OL,8,FNight as the "biggest police operation"
OL,9,Fof the year gets underway.
OL,11,FSome of them will be embedded in fire
OL,12,Fstations and will travel with crews to
OL,13,Ftackle potential attacks on
OL,14,Ffirefighters.
OL,16,FEarly evening incidents include
OL,17,Ffireworks thrown at fire appliances in
OL,18,FColinton and Oxgangs in Edinburgh and
OL,19,FKnightswood in Glasgow, though no
OL,20,Fdamage or injuries have been reported
OL,21,Fso far.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
