OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night: Biggest police
OL,4,Aoperation of the year gets underway
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs many as 1,700 officers could be
OL,7,Fdeployed to deal with fireworks-related
OL,8,Fdisorder, a European football match
OL,9,Finvolving Celtic and potential protests
OL,10,Fin Glasgow.
